<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57965" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῐσία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span>, ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽκλίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>place for lying down</i> or <i>reclining</i>:
			hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>hut, shed, booth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>. for use in peace, <i>cot, cabin</i>, once in <i><span class="en">Il.,
					18.589</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.194
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> for use
			in war, <i>hut</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. εὔπηκτος,
				εὔτυκτος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.663
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.566
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὑψηλή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.448
				</span></i>
			: freq. in pl., <i>camp</i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.487
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ ἐν κλισίῃσι βαλόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.501
				</span></i>
			:—not common after <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκηνή</span> being used), <i><span class="en">
				B.
				12.135
			</span></i>, etc.: used by Trag. in lyr. and anap., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				131
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				190
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1407
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				189
			</span></i>: later with various meanings, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βάκχου
				κλισίαι</span>, of wine-<i>shops,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				14.889
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Sinuessa</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐσεβέων κλισίη</span>, of the grave, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				237.4
			</span></i> (Smyrna, <span class="entity">ii/i B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).1104
			</span></i> (Syros, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>); <i>chapel</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κ. ἡ ἱερά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					51.220
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Thasos</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				1.219
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).123.131
			</span></i> (Epid.); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλεισία</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>anything for lying</i> or <i>sitting upon, couch</i> or
				<i>easy chair</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.123
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. δινωτὴν ἐλέφαντι καὶ ἀργύρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.55
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀλλοτρίαν κ. ἐρχόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1368.74
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>couch for reclining on at table</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.133
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾧ ξυνὴν εἶχον ἐγὼ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Aet.</u>
					1.1.8
				</span></i>
			; <i>place on such couch</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἄτιμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					59
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				2.148f
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἄδοξος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hegesand.
					18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>nuptial bed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				994
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IT</u>
				857
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>company</i> of people <i>sitting at meals,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Luc.
				9.14
			</span></i>; <i>banquet</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐωχίαι τε καὶ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					35.5
				</span></i>
			; <i>room for company</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>way of lying, decubitus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σχῆμα τῆς κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sert.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
